OL,3,AUS jobs market sees sharp slowdown
OL,4,Aahead of midterm elections
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US jobs market saw a sharp slowdown
OL,7,Fin September, with employers adding
OL,8,Fjust 29,000 jobs in the final update
OL,9,Fbefore the midterm elections.
OL,11,FHeadcounts were little changed in major
OL,12,Fsectors from tech to retail as hiring
OL,13,Ffell significantly from August,
OL,14,Faccording to figures from the Bureau of
OL,15,FLabor Statistics (BLS).
OL,17,FMeanwhile, the unemployment rate rose
OL,18,Fslightly from 4.1% in August to 4.2% in
OL,19,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
