OL,3,AUS jobs market sees sharp slowdown
OL,4,Aahead of midterm elections
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe figures signal a cooling US
OL,7,Feconomy, which experts said reduced the
OL,8,Flikelihood of a series of further
OL,9,Finterest rate hikes by the Federal
OL,10,FReserve.
